### [Backplane schematic nearly complete]($section.id('2026-02-16T00:00:00').data('author','xq'))


That's not a layout yet, but just an estimation of space for the Backplane.

Tight, but most likely doable.

Schematic is soon to be done for version 1

Also i finally got a reliable estimation for the price of the backplane materials \o/

My original estimation was "80€ for 100 PCBs", but it looks like i'm down to "50€ for the parts on the PCBs" which is really really awesome.

The PCB would cost 3.13 € per backplane with 4 layers/ENIG or 3.98 € with 6 layers/ENIG.

Now i need an estimation for the assembly cost, then we'll have reliable numbers for the final backplane PCB 😮


